{"route":{"id":"17142","name":"Passeig marítim de Roses","intro":"<strong>Ruta familiar</strong> que ens permetrà recórrer a peu o en bicicleta el <strong>passeig marítim de Roses entre la desembocadura del riu Gran i el Far de Roses. </strong> Tot passejant descobrirem els petits tresors amagats del golf de Roses. Coneixerem entre d'altres; <strong>la Ciutadella de Roses, el Port, el Castell de la Trinitat, l'interès geològic de la punta del Far, el Far de Roses</strong> i amb una mica de sort, observarem algunes <strong>aus marines prenent el sol</strong> a les roques del litoral.","tipus":"Lineal","dificultat":"Familiar","durada":"1 hora 19 minuts","desnivell":"5.00 meters","distancia":"4.61 km","tema":"Medi i arquitectura, Paisatgístic","imgs":["n17142_1.jpg","n17142_2.jpg","n17142_3.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-roses/passeig-maritim-de-roses","track":[[42.25985,3.14986],[42.25985,3.14986],[42.25987,3.14994],[42.25992,3.15007],[42.26,3.15018],[42.26006,3.15028],[42.26013,3.15039],[42.26018,3.15051],[42.26027,3.15059],[42.26032,3.1507],[42.26038,3.15081],[42.26044,3.15094],[42.26052,3.15108],[42.2606,3.15123],[42.26069,3.15137],[42.26074,3.15148],[42.2608,3.15158],[42.26085,3.15168],[42.26091,3.15179],[42.26096,3.1519],[42.26102,3.15201],[42.26107,3.15212],[42.26112,3.15224],[42.26118,3.15234],[42.26124,3.15245],[42.26129,3.15257],[42.26134,3.15268],[42.26139,3.1528],[42.26145,3.15291],[42.2615,3.15301],[42.26156,3.15311],[42.26161,3.15322],[42.26165,3.15333],[42.2617,3.15343],[42.26175,3.15353],[42.26179,3.15364],[42.26184,3.15376],[42.26188,3.15387],[42.26193,3.15398],[42.26198,3.15409],[42.26203,3.1542],[42.26209,3.15435],[42.26216,3.15449],[42.26223,3.15464],[42.26229,3.1548],[42.26234,3.15491],[42.26239,3.15502],[42.26244,3.15512],[42.26248,3.15523],[42.26253,3.15534],[42.26258,3.15544],[42.26262,3.15556],[42.26266,3.15566],[42.26273,3.15581],[42.26279,3.15596],[42.26284,3.1561],[